{"content":[{"c":["ASAHEL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Warrior among David’s mighty men known as “the thirty” (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.24","r":"2Sam.23.24","rawR":"2Sam.23.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.24","value":"2Sam.23.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.26","r":"1Chr.11.26","rawR":"1Chr.11.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.26","value":"1Chr.11.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:26"},"). Asahel was the son of David’s half sister Zeruiah and the brother of Joab and Abishai (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.2.18","r":"2Sam.2.18","rawR":"2Sam.2.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.2.18","value":"2Sam.2.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 2:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.16","r":"1Chr.2.16","rawR":"1Chr.2.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.16","value":"1Chr.2.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:16"},"). In the battle of Gibeon, David’s general Joab engaged the forces of Abner, leader of Ishbosheth’s army. Asahel, who “could run like a deer,” pursued Abner, but in the ensuing encounter Abner killed Asahel (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.2.18-23,32","r":"2Sam.2.18-23,32","rawR":"2Sam.2.18-23,32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.2.18-23,32","value":"2Sam.2.18-23,32"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 2:18-23, 32"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the Levites sent out by King Jehoshaphat of Judah to teach the people the law of the Lord (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.17.8","r":"2Chr.17.8","rawR":"2Chr.17.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.17.8","value":"2Chr.17.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 17:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Temple aide appointed by King Hezekiah to take care of the tithed offerings given to support the Levites (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.31.13","r":"2Chr.31.13","rawR":"2Chr.31.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.31.13","value":"2Chr.31.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 31:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Father of Jonathan. Jonathan (not to be confused with Saul’s son) opposed the appointment of a commission to take action concerning the foreign (pagan) wives of some of the Jews after the Babylonian exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.15","r":"Ezra.10.15","rawR":"Ezra.10.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.15","value":"Ezra.10.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Asahel","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.24","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.24","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.24"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.26"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 2:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.2.18","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.2.18","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.2.18"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.16","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.16","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.16"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 2:18-23, 32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.2.18-23,32","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.2.18-23,32","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.2.18-23,32"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 17:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.17.8","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.17.8","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.17.8"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 31:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.31.13","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.31.13","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.31.13"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.15","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.15","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7d6006bee687d46bf98b14302e702598c5c1a94fea1cdb9b5ec11eb4004a4ca0","sourceItemName":"Asahel","sourceItemOrder":517,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Asahel","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Asahel","title":"Asahel","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}